ligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{\\int \\left(-1\\right)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{- x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply our differential equation through by $I(x)=e^{- x}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}-y\\right) & =\\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right) \\\\ \\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(1\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot y & =\\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we rewrite the left hand side as $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y\\cdot I(x)):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\right) & =\\left(e^{- x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186495321 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "52024f4a-ebc0-5103-a1e8-78758bc1c99d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{4 x}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{4 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(2 x e^{- 2 x^{2}}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495327} {:answer/id #uuid "74506bb6-4469-5ca5-9318-2f49b6ac1c05" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{2 x}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{2 x}\\right)\\cdot \\left(2 x e^{- 2 x^{2}}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495336} {:answer/id #uuid "7d011e5a-cc83-508a-8044-57460dbf6338" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(x^{2}\\right)\\right)=\\left(x^{2}\\right)\\cdot \\left(2 x e^{- 2 x^{2}}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495339} {:answer/id #uuid "7e771ef1-20d6-5648-a90c-5a9d67f6ba18" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- 2 x^{2}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- 2 x^{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(2 x e^{- 2 x^{2}}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495341} {:answer/id #uuid 