}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the general solution. To find the value of $C$ corresponding to the specific solution, we apply the initial condition $y(0)=-6$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =\\frac{(6 e^{(0)})+C}{(e^{(0)})} \\\\ -6 & =\\frac{6+C}{1} \\\\ C & =-12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=6 - 12 e^{- x}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186495479 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "28742a9d-d802-59d5-837f-4c7ae6647c02" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 10 e^{- x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495394} {:answer/id #uuid "50a716cc-eef7-580a-b2ed-f4f20c746b55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(6 e^{x} + 10\\right) e^{- x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495416} {:answer/id #uuid "6203d589-0980-5569-95ab-ec6b00d190e2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 e^{x} - 10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495426} {:answer/id #uuid "90fcb6b2-2e26-5cc7-a616-6ff510c06c99" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495445} {:answer/id #uuid "95ee8c84-645f-50cc-ae00-61b9756dbf67" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 - 10 e^{- x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495448}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "95ee8c84-645f-50cc-ae00-61b9756dbf67" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 - 10 e^{- x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495448} :answer-field/id #uuid "c6bb6ecf-f464-536a-b02f-d9b8a499f987" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495470} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7662e8ff-05f8-54d1-9f1c-241683f58c6d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{2 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495432} {:answer/id #uuid "812a54e3-1cff-5d6a-84ce-bf62893be3a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{- x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186495441} {:answer/id #uu